<h2 id="pyam-map" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Pipeline map</h2>

Yes — **one E2a cell matrix YAML** fans out to **prototype HTML** and **live app data**; **E2b YAML** drives **E2b proto HTML + structural parity** while **both E2a and E2b live UIs** read the **same flat API rows** and project differently.

```mermaid
graph TD
  A[e2a data.yaml] --> B[build_all.sh]
  A2[e2b data.yaml] --> B
  B --> C[proto knowledge/practice HTML]
  B --> D[clitic_object_proto_generated_seeds.py]
  B --> E[Vitest fixture + matrix]
  B --> F[proto_contract.json]
  D --> G[bootstrap clitics --refresh]
  G --> H[(Postgres / SQLite)]
  H --> I[GET /clitics/object-forms]
  I --> J[E2a UI projector]
  I --> K[E2b UI projector]
```

| Stage | Source | Output / consumer |
|-------|--------|-------------------|
| **Proto UI** | `e2a-clitics-object-action/data.yaml`, `e2b-clitics-object-action/data.yaml` | `knowledge.html`, `practice.html` in each proto folder |
| **Seeds** | **E2a YAML only** (`emit_python_seeds.py`) | `apps/api/app/ingestion/bootstrap/clitic_object_proto_generated_seeds.py` |
| **Fixtures** | E2a YAML | `tests/e2e/unit/vitest/proto-pipeline/fixtures/e2aProtoObjectForms.generated.json` |
| **Live DB** | Bootstrap promote | `python ops/local/run_bootstrap_clitics.py --refresh` |
| **Live E2a UI** | API rows | `buildObjectActionPlacementBlocks` — `/knowledge/clitics/object-action` |
| **Live E2b UI** | Same API rows | `buildObjectActionSlotBlocks` — `/knowledge/clitics/object-action-e2b` |

**Do not edit** generated `*.py`, `*.json`, `*.html`, or `e2aProtoCellMatrix.generated.test.ts` by hand — regenerate.

**Legacy import only:** `PROTO_E2A_*.md`, `PROTO_E2B_*.md` — use `build_all.sh --import` only when intentionally re-importing; normal edits go to **`data.yaml`**.

