<h2 id="pyam-procedure" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">3. Procedure</h2>

1. **Edit YAML** — cell text, `form_example`, footnotes, register:
   - E2a matrix: `cursor_gen/refactor_plans/assets/prototypes/e2a-clitics-object-action/data.yaml`
   - E2b slot layout (must stay structurally aligned): `cursor_gen/refactor_plans/assets/prototypes/e2b-clitics-object-action/data.yaml`
2. **Regenerate** (repo root):

```bash
bash cursor_gen/refactor_plans/assets/prototypes/pipeline/build_all.sh
```

3. **Refresh DB** (when seeds changed):

```bash
python ops/local/run_bootstrap_clitics.py --refresh
```

4. **TS projector / footnote chrome** — only when layout policy changes (not pure cell text): `apps/web/src/lib/cliticsObjectActionPlacement.ts`, E2b projector files.
5. **CI parity check** (before commit):

```bash
bash cursor_gen/refactor_plans/assets/prototypes/pipeline/build_all.sh --check
```

